{"id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dtm-language-decision.md","title":"Decidable Language","display":"df-decidable-language — Decidable Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","aliases":["73-df-dtm-language-decision","73-df-decidable-language"],"display":"df-decidable-language — Decidable Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.2, print pp. 324–336; PDF pp. 346–358; local normalized interface unless explicitly BookTM","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§7.2–7.3 and §7.5, pp. 148–152, 159–166; local normalized model, not literal book tuple","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dtm-language-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dtm-language-decision</span><span>73-df-decidable-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decidable-language — Decidable Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.2, print pp. 324–336; PDF pp. 346–358; local normalized interface unless explicitly BookTM"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§7.2–7.3 and §7.5, pp. 148–152, 159–166; local normalized model, not literal book tuple"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (deterministic Turing-machine class)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> (machine semantics, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选对象、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为候选集合；接受与拒绝只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 中的机器实例调用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\bigl(M=S\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n((w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_S(w))\n\\land(w\\notin L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_S(w)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\bigl(M=S\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n((w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_S(w))\n\\land(w\\notin L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_S(w)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both membership and nonmembership force a halting outcome, so a decider halts on every input.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin