3-df-dtm-language-decision]]。"},{"id":"2c2693f4159269f6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}$ 见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]；$\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。它们均不依赖程序编码；下述接口不存在以待定义编码解释“可计算”的循环。"},{"id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}$、$\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf2}$ 与 $\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}$ 分别见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。最后的表示对应式中的 $f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 为任意部分函数，不预先假设可计算性；$\\beta$ 固定为本文件的同一双射。"},{"id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"23b25eb6ccba1a53","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数字母范围 $\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak L$ 见 [[73-df-families-of-languages]]。各固定字母表语言类见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision|Decidable Language]]"},{"id":"b1b899d5ae3caf58","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}$ (decidable binary languages, see [[73-df-dtm-language-decision]])"},{"id":"1d543e6e6f293638","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"749da0bcf0da6c50","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e3aa745a4d7cc44","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}$ (decidable binary languages, see [[73-df-dtm-language-decision]])"},{"id":"fd777d11b311e27a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f74fb6d7b9fd5e2e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"378dfa121b0216f8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2933d38e9d14eb7","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$|\\Sigma|\\ge3$。所有语言类都取同一 $\\Sigma$；正则、CFL、CSL 的空词扩展、可判定与可识别类分别见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]、[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]；CSL 的判定性见 [[73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound]]。"},{"id":"adec4a330c637abc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。识别与判定含义见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。"},{"id":"870cd425e57e823a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定有效 $B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)$，$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$。配置、转移见 [[73-df-linear-bounded-automaton]]；CSL 和判定类见 [[73-thm-lba-csl-characterization]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。"},{"id":"f2f999bbeb3c1da6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"52160274657632e4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Delta)$；$A,B\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}$、$D,E\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}$。语言类见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]；词运算和同态见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]、[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]。$h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)$。"}],"outgoing":["888d8ab66ec7efca","8630ed136c8dde2d"]}